\par\par \uc2 Business/Financial Desk; SECTB\par \b \uc2 Watchdog And Navient Reach Deal Over Loans\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tara Siegel Bernard \par \uc2 571 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2024\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The company has been banned from servicing federal student loans and must pay $100 million to harmed borrowers, as well as a $20 million penalty.\par \par \uc2 Navient\uc2 , formerly one of the nation's largest student loan servicers, reached a $120 million settlement with federal regulators on Thursday to resolve claims that it misled federal student loan borrowers and mishandled their payments for years.\par \par \uc2 The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau\uc2  said the deal would permanently ban the company from managing federal student loans and require it to pay $100 million in restitution to affected borrowers along with a $20 million penalty.\par \par \uc2 The consumer watchdog's suit had accused \uc2 Navient\uc2  of failing borrowers at every step of repayment: Among other misdeeds, it said the company steered borrowers away from more affordable income-driven repayment plans and into forbearance, which padded its own profits and forced borrowers to pay more than they had to.\par \par \uc2 ''For years, \uc2 Navient\uc2 's top executives profited handsomely by exploiting students and taxpayers,'' said \uc2 Rohit Chopra\uc2 , the director of the consumer agency. ''By banning the notorious student loan giant from federal student loan servicing and ensuring the wind down of these operations, the C.F.P.B. will finally put an end to the years of abuse.''\par \par \uc2 During a media call, agency officials said borrowers who were eligible for restitution payments did not need to do anything -- the C.F.P.B. would mail checks to ''hundreds of thousands'' of federal student loan borrowers, after it analyzed which consumers were due payments. It's unclear how long that will take. (The agency also warned borrowers to beware of scammers who might try to use C.F.P.B. imagery to steal money or private information.)\par \par \uc2 The settlement closes the book on two related legal actions that date back to 2017, when the consumer protection agency and two state attorneys general -- later backed by a coalition of attorneys general in 27 other states -- sued \uc2 Navient\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Navient\uc2  reached a settlement in 2022 with the states, which participated in a three-year investigation of student loan abuses. The deal required \uc2 Navient\uc2  to cancel delinquent private student loan debts for more than 66,000 borrowers and pay $95 million in restitution.\par \par \uc2 The company, based in Herndon, Va., was spun off from Sallie Mae in 2014. It said it did not admit to or deny any of the allegations.\par \par \uc2 ''While we do not agree with the C.F.P.B.'s allegations, this resolution is consistent with our go-forward activities and is an important positive milestone in our transformation of the company,'' \uc2 Navient\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Besides being banned from servicing federal direct loans, if entered by the court, the settlement would also prohibit \uc2 Navient\uc2  from directly servicing or acquiring most loans under the Federal Family Education Loan Program.\par \par \uc2 At the time the suits were filed, \uc2 Navient\uc2  handled $300 billion in private and federal loans for about 12 million people, including more than six million accounts under its contract with the Department of Education. It did not make student loans to federal borrowers, but held contracts to collect payments each month on behalf of banks, the government and other lenders.\par \par \uc2 Navient\uc2  ended its federal student loan servicing business in 2021, and this deal is an attempt to ensure it will not return.\par \par \uc2 This article appeared in print on page B4. \par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020240913ek9d0003k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
